            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Connector 0.1.12</h2><p>A simpler guided setup.</p><ul><li>Three clear steps with large Back and Continue buttons at the bottom.</li><li>Hype’s plugin folder opens directly for confirmation.</li><li>One primary action per step, without competing setup choices.</li><li>Updated setup documentation and bundled skill guidance.</li></ul><p>App build 78; Hype plugin 0.1.7 build 54 is unchanged. No Hype restart is needed when updating from 0.1.11 with plugin build 54 already loaded. Existing connections are preserved; Setup does not start the trial.</p>
]]></description>
